# Cutting a release

Manual rule — attach it with `@cut-release` only when shipping a version.

Procedure: @.claude/skills/cut-release/SKILL.md (background in @RELEASING.md).

- Pushing a `vX.Y.Z` tag publishes publicly. Confirm with the user before every push.
- CHANGELOG entries are written for users; the tag's section becomes the in-extension update
  prompt.
